keywords: [AI evaluation, measurement, Ed25519, governance, signed data]
abstract: >-
  Signed export of the GSPC board of AI behaviour measurements published by
  Council of AI (CSOAI Ltd). Scores come from deterministic grading on frozen
  item banks across 34 published axes, and the board is Ed25519-signed so any
  reader can re-check it client-side. Measurement, not certification.
  The DOI is the canonical citable identifier (DataCite, registered via
  Hugging Face, state: findable since 2026-08-25). Live board:
  https://councilof.ai/api/gspc — free to verify, no account.
